{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"e1fc956a-6247-4034-be70-d76ef834787a","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented analytics events as defined in **docs/EVENTS.md** for the registration and offer screens, using the existing `Analytics` wrapper.\n\nKey updates:\n- Added flags to ensure events fire only once per screen visit.\n- Wrapped email/phone `onChanged` callbacks to capture `registration_email_started` and `registration_phone_started`.\n- Added `onChangeEnd` to the loan amount slider to capture `loan_amount_changed` with the selected amount.\n- Modified the terms checkbox to capture `terms_accepted` on first check.\n- Updated the Continue button to capture `registration_continue_tapped` with `amount` and `terms` properties.\n- Wrapped the offers list in a `ScrollEndNotification` listener to capture `offers_scrolled` with scroll offset.\n\nSee the detailed changes and rationale in the generated **ANSWER.md** file.\n","duration_seconds":105.826987,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":24011,"output_tokens":10123,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":266624,"total_tokens":34134}}}
